    "whoUses": "Addiction medicine specialists, psychiatrists, emergency department physicians, and hospital-based medical teams use this code when treating patients with substance use disorders who present with delirium. It typically appears in inpatient hospital settings rather than routine outpatient care and may be seen on EOB statements for emergency room visits or psychiatric hospitalizations.",
