    "whoUses": "Addiction medicine specialists, psychiatrists, emergency medicine doctors, and substance abuse counselors use this code when treating patients with cocaine use disorder. It commonly appears on EOB statements for patients seeking treatment in addiction clinics, emergency departments, or behavioral health facilities, and may also be used during inpatient psychiatric or medical detoxification programs.",
