    "whoUses": "This code is used by addiction medicine specialists, psychiatrists, primary care physicians, and emergency medicine doctors in settings ranging from outpatient substance abuse treatment programs to hospital detoxification units and rehabilitation facilities. It commonly appears on EOBs for patients receiving treatment for cocaine use disorder, including counseling, medication-assisted therapy, or inpatient detoxification services.",
