    "whoUses": "Addiction medicine specialists, psychiatrists, and primary care doctors use this code when treating patients with stimulant use disorder who report sexual dysfunction as a comorbid issue. It commonly appears in mental health and substance abuse treatment settings but is less frequently seen on standard patient EOB statements unless sexual dysfunction is being actively addressed as part of addiction treatment.",
