    "whoUses": "Psychiatrists, addiction medicine specialists, and primary care doctors use this code when treating patients with substance use disorders. It commonly appears on EOB statements for people receiving treatment at addiction clinics, psychiatric hospitals, or during office visits with providers managing stimulant abuse and its sleep-related complications.",
