    "whoUses": "This code is primarily used by addiction medicine specialists, psychiatrists, and emergency medicine doctors when evaluating patients with stimulant use disorder who present while actively intoxicated. It commonly appears on EOB statements for rehabilitation facilities, psychiatric hospitalizations, and emergency department visits related to substance use treatment.",
