    "whoUses": "Addiction medicine specialists, psychiatrists, emergency medicine doctors, and intensive care physicians use this code when treating patients in acute intoxication with severe confusion or delirium related to stimulant use. This code is common in hospital and emergency department settings but rarely appears on routine patient EOBs unless the patient is being billed for emergency or inpatient psychiatric care.",
