    "plainEnglish": "This code indicates that a person has become physically and/or psychologically dependent on hallucinogenic drugs—substances like LSD, psilocybin mushrooms, or mescaline that cause altered perceptions and hallucinations. The person experiences cravings, uses the drug regularly despite wanting to stop, and may experience withdrawal symptoms when not using. 'Uncomplicated' means they don't currently have additional serious medical or psychiatric conditions directly caused by the drug use (such as psychosis or organ damage), though dependence itself is a serious condition requiring treatment.",
