    "plainEnglish": "This code indicates that someone has used hallucinogenic drugs (such as LSD, psilocybin mushrooms, or similar substances) in a way that has led to anxiety disorder as a direct result of the drug use. The hallucinogens have triggered ongoing anxiety symptoms—like excessive worry, panic, or physical anxiety responses—that persist even when the person isn't actively using the drug. This is essentially the medical way of documenting that hallucinogen use has caused a diagnosed anxiety condition that requires treatment.",
