    "plainEnglish": "This code means you are addicted to nicotine (from cigarettes, vaping, or other tobacco products) and are experiencing withdrawal symptoms when you try to quit or reduce your use. Withdrawal can include irritability, anxiety, difficulty concentrating, increased appetite, and strong cravings for nicotine. It's a recognized medical condition that doctors use to document your addiction and help guide treatment to help you quit smoking or vaping.",
