    "plainEnglish": "This code means you have a dependency on a psychoactive substance other than alcohol, opioids, cannabis, stimulants, hallucinogens, or inhalants—such as medications or other mood-altering drugs—and you don't currently have serious complications from that dependence. Substance dependence occurs when your body or mind becomes reliant on a drug, making it difficult to stop using even though you want to or know it's causing problems.",
