    "whoUses": "Addiction medicine specialists, psychiatrists, emergency medicine physicians, and substance use disorder treatment providers use this code when evaluating patients with intoxication from unspecified or multiple psychoactive substances. It commonly appears in emergency department and urgent care visits, and may appear on EOB statements when substance use is the primary reason for evaluation or treatment.",
