    "code": "F45.9",
    "rawCode": "F459",
    "shortDesc": "Somatoform disorder, unspecified",
    "longDesc": "Somatoform disorder, unspecified",
    "plainEnglish": "This diagnosis means you have physical symptoms that cannot be fully explained by medical testing or an identifiable medical condition, and these symptoms are significantly affecting your daily life or causing you distress. Your body is experiencing real pain, fatigue, weakness, or other uncomfortable sensations, but doctors have not found a specific disease or injury causing them—instead, the symptoms are believed to be connected to psychological or emotional factors. This is sometimes called a functional symptom or medically unexplained symptom.",
