    "whoUses": "Sleep medicine specialists, psychiatrists, primary care physicians, and occupational health doctors use this code when evaluating chronic fatigue and sleep deprivation issues. It appears less frequently on patient EOBs compared to other sleep disorders, as it's often treated through lifestyle counseling and sleep hygiene education rather than specialized procedures or intensive treatments.",
