    "plainEnglish": "This code indicates that a person is misusing steroids or hormones—taking them without a doctor's prescription, in higher doses than prescribed, or for purposes other than their intended medical use. This can include anabolic steroids used to build muscle, estrogen or testosterone taken without medical supervision, or other hormone products obtained illegally or diverted from legitimate prescriptions. People with this diagnosis may experience physical side effects like mood changes, hormonal imbalances, liver problems, or cardiovascular complications, depending on what substance is being abused.",
