    "whoUses": "Psychiatrists, psychologists, pediatricians, and adolescent medicine specialists use this code when evaluating teenagers with persistent behavioral problems. It commonly appears on mental health treatment EOBs and insurance claims for counseling, therapy, or psychiatric medication management, though it may be less frequently seen by patients unfamiliar with behavioral health coding.",
